# Code Owners
#
# This file defines who is automatically requested for review on pull
# requests. GitHub matches patterns top-to-bottom and the LAST matching
# pattern for a given path wins, so keep the whole-tree default first and add
# more specific area owners below it as the maintainer team grows.
#
# To add an area owner, append a more specific pattern after the default,
# for example:
#   /src/services/memory/  @some-other-maintainer
#   /docs/                 @docs-maintainer
#
# See https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

